      "time": "2026-09-30T19:13:25.871974",
      "type": "moment"
    },
    {
      "content": "I'm doing great. Thank you so much for calling us back right away, we received your request for an estimate and I just have some questions regarding your move. This call will just be around ten to fifteen minutes would that be fine?",
      "name": "Nicole Cruz",
      "time": "2026-09-30T19:13:27.874720",
