      "user_id": "6472503510835200"
    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgICcr5aeyQoM",
      "content": "That's fine.",
      "name": "Delinda Maher",
      "time": "2026-09-30T19:13:40.715974",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Awesome, so I can see you're moving on Friday October 9th based on the size of your home, we usually do a virtual walkthrough, it's like a video call on your preferred time and date. So we can see the items we have to move and we can identify how many movers and how many trucks you will be needing for this move. Are you comfortable though virtual walkthroughs?",
      "name": "Nicole Cruz",
      "time": "2026-09-30T19:13:41.674720",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "6472503510835200"
    },
    {
      "content": "ai_scorecard_llm_v2",
      "name": "Nicole Cruz",
      "time": "2026-09-30T19:13:41.674720",
      "type": "moment",
