      "user_id": "6472503510835200"
    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgICcr5aeyQoM",
      "content": "Yeah but I think more than anything, I'm trying to get an idea of are you, do you guys charge hourly or how are, how are you charging?",
      "name": "Delinda Maher",
      "time": "2026-09-30T19:14:07.715974",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgICcr5aeyQoM",
      "content": "call_purpose",
      "name": "Delinda Maher",
      "time": "2026-09-30T19:14:07.715974",
      "type": "moment"
    },
    {
      "content": "Mm-hmm.",
      "name": "Nicole Cruz",
      "time": "2026-09-30T19:14:15.274720",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "6472503510835200"
    },
    {
      "content": "Yes. So we are a time based company. We charge hourly we will be charging you for the total time consumed by the end of the move and we charge $109 per hour per mover. Usually for the size of your home we send out six movers and three trucks. So if we will be sending six movers, just 109 time six. That will be $654 per hour.",
      "name": "Nicole Cruz",
      "time": "2026-09-30T19:14:18.274720",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "6472503510835200"
    },
    {
