    },
    {
      "content": "monologuing",
      "name": "Nicole Cruz",
      "time": "2026-09-30T19:14:48.663720",
      "type": "moment",
      "user_id": "6472503510835200"
    },
    {
      "content": "And with this hourly rate, everything is included like the fuel and truck taxes, insurance. All wrap pads and bans to protect your items when being moved and all the tools for this assembly and reassembly of your furniture and appliances. There are no hidden fees of any type, no credit card fees, no transportation fees, no stairwell fees, no disassemble or reassembly fees. Again, no hidden fees of any type. And once we do the virtual walkthrough I can identify if how many movers and truck you will be needing for the move. Alternatively if virtual walkthrough will not work, you can just send us some photos or videos on a secure link that I can send to you.",
